. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * OLS is estimated with Political Attitudes (plh0004) as the dependen
> t variables
.         * plh0004 directly asks respondants to place themselves on a left--ri
> ght scale. 
.         * Controls are then included for: income, education, marital status, 
> and year 
.         * The dependent variable of interest is d_daughter, a dummy variable 
> which =1 if have a daughter 
. 
